{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":21,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫的覆滅"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["論海旁曠野的默示：",{"text":"有仇敵從曠野，從可怕之地而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像南方的旋風，猛然掃過。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令人悽慘的異象已默示於我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"詭詐的行詭詐，毀滅的行毀滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以攔哪，你要上去！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"米底亞啊，你要圍困！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主說：我使一切歎息止住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我滿腰疼痛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"痛苦將我抓住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像產難的婦人一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我疼痛甚至不能聽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我驚惶甚至不能看。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心慌張，驚恐威嚇我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所羨慕的黃昏，變為我的戰兢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們擺設筵席，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派人守望，又吃又喝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領啊，你們起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用油抹盾牌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主對我如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你去設立守望的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他將所看見的述說。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他看見軍隊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是騎馬的一對一對地來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又看見驢隊，駱駝隊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就要側耳細聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像獅子吼叫，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，我白日常站在望樓上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整夜立在我守望所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，有一隊軍兵騎着馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一對一對地來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他就說：巴比倫傾倒了！傾倒了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一切雕刻的神像都打碎於地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我被打的禾稼，我場上的穀啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從萬軍之耶和華－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的上帝那裏所聽見的，都告訴你們了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["論以東的信息"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"論度瑪的默示：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有人聲從西珥呼問我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望的啊，夜裏如何？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望的啊，夜裏如何？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"守望的說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"早晨將到，黑夜也來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們若要問就可以問，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以回頭再來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["論阿拉伯的信息"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"論阿拉伯的默示：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底但結伴的客旅啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必在阿拉伯的樹林中住宿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提瑪地的居民拿水來，送給口渴的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿餅來迎接逃避的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們逃避刀劍和出了鞘的刀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並上了弦的弓與刀兵的重災。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["主對我這樣說：「一年之內，照雇工的年數，基達的一切榮耀必歸於無有。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["弓箭手所餘剩的，就是基達人的勇士，必然稀少，因為這是耶和華－以色列的上帝說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/21.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/22.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/20.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}